{"channelId":"UCHdjFaohc04GhNzw-memMew","row":["In The Vet's Office with Dr. Josie Horchak",582,"iHeartMedia and The Nashville Podcast Network presents \"In The Vet's Office\" with Dr. Josie Horchak. Each episode, veterinarian Dr. Josie Horchak, sits down with her co-host Shannon Ella to answer questions she's constantly hearing at the office -- What should I feed my dog? How do I potty train my puppy? Do I really need to brush my pet's teeth? Dr. Josie helps listeners navigate pet ownership through sharing cases she's seen in her 18+ year career as a veterinarian, answering listener calls, and giving her weekly \"Paw & Order\" list of things she would never do with her own pets. Dr. Josie has treated pets from the high rises of downtown Chicago to the pets of country stars in Nashville. Her ability to relate with owners has made her one of the most sought-after veterinarians in the country.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCHdjFaohc04GhNzw-memMew","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCHdjFaohc04GhNzw-memMew","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:00.932Z","channelId":"UCHdjFaohc04GhNzw-memMew","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"1964a4536bbf0a16918399c6e311c5639ecfd8677866b5cb5565df2ba744294b","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"159441f29b9aba9ff79aadae91777b0a03cea920727464778040d8b88369c057"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCHdjFaohc04GhNzw-memMew","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":582,"raw":"582 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCHdjFaohc04GhNzw-memMew","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:00.932Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["veterinary"],"relevantKeywords":["veterinary"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"veterinary","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"single_sample","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JgmE09czp